{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16218170","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16218170","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1621817001:1":{"text":"Thank you, everyone! I'll stick to my mission and won't let any of you down.","source_cn":"谢谢大家！请放心，我一定会肩负起责任，不会辜负大家的期望的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79C97068D15D8E5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1621817001":{"text":"Thank you, everyone! I'll stick to my mission and won't let any of you down.","source_cn":"谢谢大家！请放心，我一定会肩负起责任，不会辜负大家的期望的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79C97068D15D8E5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1621817002:0":{"text":"I hear the court has been rather chaotic lately... Trust no one lightly.","source_cn":"是啊，听说最近宫廷里不大太平……那里人际关系太过于复杂...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77F099CD4428EDD1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:0:1":{"text":"Stay safe.","source_cn":"重要的是注意安全","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1C1C1B57DE199643","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Stay safe.","female":"Stay safe.","variant_male_record_index":"86091","variant_female_record_index":"86092","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1621817003:0":{"text":"Right... Cyran's the chief court mage!","source_cn":"对哦……他可是首席宫廷魔法师！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAC9197966F32F1BC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Right... Cyran's the chief court mage!","female":"Right... Cyran's the chief court mage!","variant_male_record_index":"215821","variant_female_record_index":"215822","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1621817004:0":{"text":"Don't worry, I'll watch my step.","source_cn":"别担心，我会小心行事的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9E852BE492D54B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:1:2":{"text":"Be careful around Cyran.","source_cn":"要小心迪尔格雷","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0216EA11B009E121","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Be careful around Cyran.","female":"Be careful around Cyran.","variant_male_record_index":"86093","variant_female_record_index":"86094","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1621817005:0":{"text":"Thank you, Magister Merlin!","source_cn":"谢谢您，梅林大人！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE451D17068BBFB9A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Thank you, Magister Merlin!","female":"Thank you, Magister Merlin!","variant_male_record_index":"215824","variant_female_record_index":"215825","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1621817008:1":{"text":"Let's keep in touch. Come back and play tabletop games with us when you have time! Savannah isn't too far away.","source_cn":"小家伙，有空的时候记得跟我们联系，赛凡纳离莱希拉姆不远...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8259734D9E9AB73","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1621817009:1":{"text":"Come to think of it, we'll be one player short after Cassadee leaves. Does that mean our club activities have to stop?","source_cn":"说起来，科丝蒂离开后，跑团俱乐部缺了一个人，是不是活动...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE84E3EA4A79985A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1621817010:1":{"text":"No worries, I've recruited a new player! I'm certain she's a perfect fit for the club.","source_cn":"啊，关于这件事，请各位放心，我已经联络好一位也对跑团感...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE418ABEFFAB93B94","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1621817011:1":{"text":"Only those who are able to see Contess can play the game. Could the new member be...","source_cn":"要想加入俱乐部，就需要看到康缇丝。科丝蒂说的人选莫非是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE301B9315B799A98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1621817012:1":{"text":"You meet the new player shortly after.","source_cn":"很快，你们就知道科丝蒂说的人是谁了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x00A7DD21047F7942","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You meet the new player shortly after.","female":"You meet the new player shortly after.","variant_male_record_index":"215833","variant_female_record_index":"215834","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1621817013:1":{"text":"Good evening.","source_cn":"夜安。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35C235703A341023","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:19:1621817013":{"text":"Good evening.","source_cn":"夜安。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35C235703A341023","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1621817014:1":{"text":"I had to play the game over and over again while Contess was working on it. The rules in the early version were a bit unclear, but Cassadee assures me it's much more fun now.","source_cn":"在研发时我已经被迫体验了不少次。最开始的规则有些令人疑...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CBBF96696B8426F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1621817015:1":{"text":"I've prepared my character card. Let's begin.","source_cn":"我已经制作好了角色卡，开始吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A58D05729431CB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:22:1621817015":{"text":"I've prepared my character card. Let's begin.","source_cn":"我已经制作好了角色卡，开始吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A58D05729431CB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1621817016:1":{"text":"Relax, I'm very familiar with the rules.","source_cn":"放心。我对游戏规则很熟悉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B08A7796757B1FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1621817017:1":{"text":"Um, Little Zorya, I remember the first time you played, I had to give you ten reminders just to get you to roll the dice before taking action...","source_cn":"咦，小佐尔娅，你该不会忘了吧？你第一次玩的时候，光是记...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0565928175B749F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1621817018:1":{"text":"Wrong. It was nine reminders.","source_cn":"错误，是九遍。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E05C066E3376A2F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:27:1621817019:1":{"text":"Beneath the moonless sky, laughter and chatter spill from the library lounge.","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5343DC1447AF3AE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:22:0:1":{"text":"You don't need a tutorial?","source_cn":"不需要再新手教学了？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x53B3EAD842E723CD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You don't need a tutorial?","female":"You don't need a t